---
title: 14 - Job Lifecycle State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> queued: Valid upload / create pipeline job
 queued --> running: Worker selects job
 running --> complete: Work returns and finalization succeeds
 running --> failed: Uncaught exception / save error
 running --> queued: Worker restart / recover interrupted job
 failed --> queued: POST retry / preserve current kind
 complete --> queued: POST summary [result exists and LLM enabled]
 failed --> queued: POST summary [result exists and LLM enabled]
 note right of queued
  kind=pipeline: stages M1-M5 and optional M6
  kind=summary: M6 only
  POST summary sets kind=summary
 end note
 note right of running
  status=running does not identify a stage
  Pipeline cache hits may skip model work
  Worker owns a process file lock per store root
 end note
 note right of complete
  Initial caught M6 error may still complete
  Regeneration exceptions result in failed
  Edits change revision, not job status
 end note
